---
import ProjectLayout from "../../layouts/ProjectLayout.astro";
import ProjectSection from "../../components/blocks/ProjectSection.astro";
---

<ProjectLayout
  title="Project Hephaestus"
  heroImage="/images/projects/hephaestus/project-hephaestus-banner.png"
  heroAlt="Project Hephaestus — Forge Forward."
>
  <ProjectSection title="Overview">
    <p>
      Project Hephaestus is the Arasmas Labs initiative focused on turning
      technical capability into practical craftsmanship, products, and
      sustainable business development.
    </p>

    <p>
      The project aims to explore the intersection of technology, craftsmanship, and
      business development, with a focus on creating high-quality products and 
      services that are both innovative and practical. The project will leverage the
      technical expertise and capabilities of the lab to create products that are not only
      functional and efficient, but also aesthetically pleasing and well-crafted. The goal
      is to create a sustainable business model that can support the continued development
      of the lab and its projects, while also providing value to customers and clients.
    </p>

    <p> 
    The first commercial expression of the project is Fractured Smile Laser Engravings, combining
    hands-on production with digital design and fabrication. 
    </p>
  </ProjectSection>

  <ProjectSection title="Current Focus">
    <p>
      Current development is centered on establishing the initial engraving
      workflow, refining the first product range, and building the production
      systems needed to support a lean one-person operation. 
    </p>

    <p>
      Hephaestus seeks to establish the first sustainable business model with plans for the 
      future involving a broader community of makers, designers, and engineers. Our current focus
      is on building a strong foundation for the project, leading with the motto "Forge Forward" 
      as we continue to explore new opportunities for growth and development.
    </p>

    <p>
      The current focus is in establishing the initial business first, while we acquire 
      materials, tools, and equipment to support the development of a broader range of products.
    </p>
  </ProjectSection>

  <ProjectSection title="Naming Convention">
    <p>
      The name "Hephaestus" is derived from the Greek god of fire, metalworking, and 
      craftsmanship. This reflects the project's focus on practical fabrication,
      craftsmanship, and the creation of high-quality products and tools. The name
      symbolizes the project's aspiration to forge forward in the pursuit of innovation
      and excellence, while also serving as a reminder of the importance of skill, precision,
      and attention to detail in the creation of functional and aesthetically pleasing products.
    </p>
  </ProjectSection>
</ProjectLayout>